tative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A very curious person with a strong sense of justice, and he enjoys \"playing detective,\" though he isn't always very good at it. He is very kind and takes a very \"older brother\" approach to people. He is also very innocent when it comes to sex."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Boys' Love Game Headquarters"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c26164"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2f/2fee33ac90bfccc3eadfbbda1285788d1b202789d5d11fa6b3aa1704302f1d9d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e0/e08a00ff7f6ae63891f177f4d10095728deab168d406cf45d86187e16101f21c.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c26165","characterName":"潤・アフレック","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c26165"},"originalCharacterName":"潤・アフレック","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Jun is half-Japanese, half-American, inheriting his blond hair from his mother. He previously lived in America for three years, but now he is the next door neighbor and best friend of Takumi, who taught him Japanese. He likes Takumi very much, and is rather touchy with Takumi, and hugging or kissing is a daily occurrence between the friends, and innocent Takumi doesn't seem to mind too much."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Boys' Love Game Headquarters"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c26165"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/44/44abf6ac611df0a92d32fb44412133f53c0c9